zefl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad9506ea-17cf-43ec-8744-84cb341d7569","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Rust でやってる人いたね \u0026gt;コンパイルエラー爆発","ts":"1628217086.269600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]},{"name":"sugoi","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gwu9T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f47bcdcc-0ea0-4ae1-beec-862b4e643a0b","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u0026gt; 少し前に、\u003chttp://d.hatena.ne.jp/keyword/C%2B%2B|C++\u003eの\u003chttp://d.hatena.ne.jp/keyword/%A5%B3%A5%F3%A5%D1%A5%A4%A5%EB|コンパイル\u003eエラーの長さを競うコンテストが開催されていました。\n既にお腹いっぱいwww","ts":"1628217042.268700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r0UTy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa56294a-d799-46ed-ba90-5e7af758a0b9","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ムーブとは話がずれますがこういうのが…エラーメッセージはやばかったし他もいろいろやばかったですね\n\u003chttps://faithandbrave.hateblo.jp/entry/2014/03/25/150659\u003e","ts":"1628217013.268100","attachments":[{"fallback":"Faith and Brave - C++で遊ぼう: C++のコンパイルエラー爆発を競うコンテスト - Faith and Brave - C++で遊ぼう","id":1,"title":"C++のコンパイルエラー爆発を競うコンテスト - Faith and Brave - C++で遊ぼう","title_link":"https://faithandbrave.hateblo.jp/entry/2014/03/25/150659","text":"Results of the Grand C++ Error Explosion Competition 少し前に、C++のコンパイルエラーの長さを競うコンテストが開催されていました。 受賞のカテゴリは2つあり、ひとつめは最小コードで最大のコンパイルエラーを出した人、もうひとつは芸術的な評価による受賞です。 最小コードで最大のコンパイルエラー この部門で優勝したのはEd Hanwayさんという方で、ソースコード量に対して59億倍のコンパイルエラーメッセージを出力したそうです。 それには、自身を2回インクルードするという手法が使われていたそうです。 #include \".//.//.//.//j…","image_url":"https://ogimage.blog.st-hatena.com/12921228815714321046/12921228815720607720/1498143072","blocks":null,"ts":1395727619,"service_name":"Faith and Brave - C++で遊ぼう","service_icon":"https://faithandbrave.hateblo.jp/icon/touch","from_url":"https://faithandbrave.hateblo.jp/entry/2014/03/25/150659","original_url":"https://faithandbrave.hateblo.jp/entry/2014/03/25/150659"}],"edited":{"user":"UKHUVMBJR","ts":"1628217025.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5P2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e2d85dd-7fc9-4d84-b721-4eacd6d47862","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"C++ のその辺の苦労は経験がないのでわからないですが、つらそうだなと思いますｗ","ts":"1628216854.267500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Epl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45715c38-e500-4b99-9510-18f5a2506b67","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"TypeScript 書いてても Go 書いてても欲しくなる","ts":"1628216791.266900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+Gr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"128d3a40-2257-45e2-9158-e46f28ba5b5f","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"C++11のときに無限に手動でムーブしてたんで便利になったもんだな〜と思って見てました","ts":"1628216788.266800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":2,"users":["U776661HA","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q/V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a18625d6-2166-4850-8d13-9f85ef950b7c","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ちなみに「コピー」ではなく「移動」ですね。なので多重Closeされない（実態が一個しか無い）感じです。","ts":"1628216707.266100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":2,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QP1cb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbb07b5c-a8b8-4e40-a237-9034deae583d","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"合ってたよかった。あざます :pray:","ts":"1628216471.265000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u9bw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e856a653-4da4-40a2-baaf-cea358cc7676","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"そうだと思います。もちろん意図的に壊すことは出来ると思いますが、普通そういうことしないので","ts":"1628216457.264700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uWiP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cdb6dea8-073c-43e0-a137-afd9dc52527c","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"でもってコピーしても所有権があるので二重Closeされたりはしないってことでいいですかね？","ts":"1628216335.263200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nknj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f474ffe-f1a9-43d4-a502-dc6bd01089e7","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"おーRAIIっぽい","ts":"1628216218.262600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3ZVtK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F66CA23F-1A83-4657-8245-20A697951476","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"Closeが確実に呼ばれるようにという意味ではデストラクタあるので防げると思います（束縛してる変数の生存期間が明確なので）。\nただ、絶対リークしないか？とかの意味であればメモリリークと同じでリークしてしまうようなケースはあると思います。","ts":"1628216202.262400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ugN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6986c79c-865f-4a6b-baf6-1d2bf73490e8","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"最近、メモリリークとファイルハンドル等のリークは外部リソースの管理の失敗という意味で\nまったく同じことであるという悟りを開いたのですが、\nRustでメモリ以外のリソースのリークを言語機能で防ぐことって可能ですか？","ts":"1628215898.259100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lqw"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"\u003c@UKHUVMBJR\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1628215849.258100","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
